'''Description:''' Clerics who take the Plant domain are able to repel and destroy vermin and have spells that call upon the power of nature to protect and destroy.[[Image:Id plant.gif|right|Plant]]
== Domain Special Abilities ==

Able to [[Turn undead|turn]] [[vermin]] as if they were [[undead]].

== Bonus Spells ==
* Level 2 [[Barkskin]]
* Level 7 [[Creeping doom]]

==Notes==
*The cleric can turn vermin without penalty as if they were undead.
*[[Sun domain]] improves the strength of turning.

